  "title": "Radio",
  "group": "Selection",
  "order": 2,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Native radio buttons for exactly one choice out of two to five options that should all be visible. The dot springs in; arrow keys move between options.",
    "id": "Radio button bawaan untuk tepat satu pilihan dari dua sampai lima opsi yang semuanya harus terlihat. Titiknya memantul masuk; tombol panah berpindah antaropsi."
  },
  "titleId": "Radio",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Delivery method",
        "desc": "Click an option or focus the group and use the arrow keys. The dot springs in; the old one shrinks out faster.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Where should we send your results?</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\" checked><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Email<small>siti@contoh.id</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Push notification<small>On the phone you signed in with</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Both</span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Service session",
        "desc": "Session slots are radios: one answer, all visible, keyboard friendly. A full session is disabled and stays readable.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0; max-width: 520px;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Which session for e-KTP recording at Kedaton district office?</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Monday, 08:00</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Monday, 10:00</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\" checked><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Tuesday, 08:00</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\" disabled><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Tuesday, 10:00<small>Full</small></span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Cara pengiriman",
        "desc": "Klik sebuah opsi atau fokuskan kelompoknya lalu pakai tombol panah. Titik memantul masuk; titik lama mengecil keluar lebih cepat.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Ke mana hasilnya dikirim?</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\" checked><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Email<small>siti@contoh.id</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Notifikasi aplikasi<small>Di ponsel yang Anda pakai untuk masuk</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Keduanya</span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Sesi layanan",
        "desc": "Pilihan sesi adalah radio: satu jawaban, semua terlihat, ramah keyboard. Sesi yang penuh nonaktif dan tetap terbaca.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0; max-width: 520px;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Sesi mana untuk perekaman KTP elektronik di Kantor Kecamatan Kedaton?</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Senin, 08.00</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Senin, 10.00</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\" checked><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Selasa, 08.00</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\" disabled><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Selasa, 10.00<small>Penuh</small></span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      }
    ]
  },
